097919470\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" aria-label=\\\"Abrir curr&iacute;culo Lattes de Eliza Melo da Costa\\\">Acessar</a></td></tr><tr class=\\\"fisica-docentes-row\\\" data-search=\\\"gerson pech ci&ecirc;ncia da informa&ccedil;&atilde;o, cientometria e bibliometria 3002-a\\\"><td data-label=\\\"Docente\\\">Gerson Pech</td><td data-label=\\\"&Aacute;rea de pesquisa\\\">Ci&ecirc;ncia da informa&ccedil;&atilde;o, Cientometria e Bibliometria</td><td data-label=\\\"Sala\\\">3002-A</td><td data-label=\\\"Lattes\\\"><a href=\\\"http://lattes.cnpq.br/5958377565632407\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" aria-label=\\\"Abrir curr&iacute;culo Lattes de Gerson Pech\\\">Acessar</a></td></tr><tr class=\\\"fisica-docentes-row\\\" data-search=\\\"gilson correia silva f&iacute;sica experimental de altas energias 3018-a\\\"><td data-label=\\\"Docente\\\">Gilson Correia Silva</td><td data-label=\\\"&Aacute;rea de pesquisa\\\">F&iacute;sica Experimental de Altas Energias</td><td data-label=\\\"Sala\\\">3018-A</td><td data-label=\\\"Lattes\\\"><a href=\\\"https://buscatextual.cnpq.br/buscatextual/visualizacv.do?metodo=apresentar&amp;id=K4474278P7\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" aria-label=\\\"Abrir curr&iacute;culo Lattes de Gilson Correia Silva\\\">Acessar</a></td></tr><tr class=\\\"fisica-docentes-row\\\" data-search=\\\"helena brand&atilde;o malbouisson f&iacute;sica experimental de altas energias 3018-a\\\"><td data-label=\\\"Docente\\\">Helena Brand&atilde;o Malbouisson</td><td data-label=\\\"&Aacute;rea de pesquisa\\\">F&iacute;sica Experimental de Altas Energias</td><td data-label=\\\"Sala\\\">3018-A</td><td data-label=\\\"Lattes\\\"><a href=\\\"http://lattes.cnpq.br/6149366713641382\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" aria-label=\\\"Abrir curr&iacute;culo Lattes de Helena Brand&atilde;o Malbouisson\\\">Acessar</a></td></tr><tr class=\\\"fisica-docentes-row\\\" data-search=\\\"he