00e2mbito dessa atua\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/p>\\n          <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-grid\\\">\\n            <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-05-21-170506.png\\\" alt=\\\"Cosmologia e Gravita\\u00e7\\u00e3o - imagem 1\\\">\\n            <\\/figure>\\n            <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-05-21-170434.png\\\" alt=\\\"Cosmologia e Gravita\\u00e7\\u00e3o - imagem 2\\\">\\n            <\\/figure>\\n          <\\/div>\\n          <p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__topics\\\">Cosmologia; Buracos negros; Ondas gravitacionais; Radia\\u00e7\\u00e3o gravitacional e din\\u00e2mica relativ\\u00edstica; Colapso gravitacional; Componentes escuros do universo (mat\\u00e9ria e energia escuras); Modelos inflacion\\u00e1rios e cosmologia primordial; Condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es iniciais do universo; Forma\\u00e7\\u00e3o de estruturas em larga escala; Reaquecimento inflacion\\u00e1rio; Caos no universo primordial; Teorias alternativas da gravita\\u00e7\\u00e3o; Gravita\\u00e7\\u00e3o com dimens\\u00f5es extras; Modelos an\\u00e1logos de gravita\\u00e7\\u00e3o; Solu\\u00e7\\u00f5es exatas das equa\\u00e7\\u00f5es de Einstein; Gravita\\u00e7\\u00e3o qu\\u00e2ntica (Horava-Lifshitz); Colis\\u00f5es e fus\\u00f5es de sistemas compactos; Relatividade num\\u00e9rica (BSSN, formalismo caracter\\u00edstico, m\\u00e9todos espectrais, Einstein Toolkit).<\\/p>\\n        <\\/section>\\n      <\\/div>\\n    <\\/div>\\n    <aside class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar\\\"><a class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-link\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/#programas\\\">Voltar para pesquisa<\\/a><\\/aside>\\n  <\\/div>\\n<\\/section>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\",\"scripts\":[],\"styles\":[]}}'),(8391,573,'_elementor_page_assets','a:1:{s:7:\"scripts\";a:1:{i:0;s:18:\"elementor-frontend\";}}'),(8392,573,'_elementor_css','a:6:{s:4:\"time\";i:1785528078;s:5:\"fonts\";a:0:{}s:5:\"icons\";a:0:{}s:20:\"dynamic_elements_ids\";a:0:{}s:6:\"status\";s:4:\"file\";i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(8393,573,'_elementor_element_cache','{\"timeout\":1785603678,\"value\":{\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-detail_573 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"detail_573\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-html_573 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\\\" data-id=\\\"html_573\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"html.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__hero\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__hero-card\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__eyebrow\\\">Linha de Pesquisa<\\/span>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__title\\\">Ensino de F\\u00edsica e Educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o Cient\\u00edfica<\\/h1>\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/div>\\n  <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__content\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__panel\\\">\\n        <section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__section\\\">\\n          <h2>Ensino de F\\u00edsica e Educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o Cient\\u00edfica<\\/h2>\\n          <p>Os professores do Instituto que atuam nesta \\u00e1rea dedicam-se \\u00e0 forma\\u00e7\\u00e3o de professores e ao desenvolvimento de pr\\u00e1ticas educacionais em F\\u00edsica. A seguir, s\\u00e3o apresentados os principais temas de pesquisa relacionados a essa atua\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/p>\\n          <p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__topics\\\">Forma\\u00e7\\u00e3o inicial e continuada de professores de F\\u00edsica; Hist\\u00f3ria e filosofia da ci\\u00eancia no ensino; Hist\\u00f3ria da ci\\u00eancia numa abordagem sociocultural; Natureza da ci\\u00eancia e abordagens socioculturais; Ensino de F\\u00edsica e curr\\u00edculo; Pol\\u00edticas p\\u00fablicas; Processos de ensino e aprendizagem em ci\\u00eancias;<\\/p>\\n          <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 460px; margin: 22px 0 26px auto; min-height: auto; padding: 14px 16px;\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-06-09-133405.png\\\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\\\"yes\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\\\"ensino-fisica-citacoes\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\\\"Ensino de F\\u00edsica e Educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o Cient\\u00edfica - imagem 1\\\" style=\\\"display:block; width:100%; text-decoration:none;\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-06-09-133405.png\\\" alt=\\\"Ensino de F\\u00edsica e Educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o Cient\\u00edfica - imagem 1\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" style=\\\"display:block; width:auto; height:auto; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; image-rendering:auto; cursor:zoom-in;\\\">\\n            <\\/a>\\n          <\\/figure>\\n          <p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__topics\\\">Pr\\u00e1ticas pedag\\u00f3gicas, ensino experimental e atividades com materiais de baixo custo; Estrat\\u00e9gias did\\u00e1ticas inovadoras e pedagogia de projetos; Interdisciplinaridade no ensino de ci\\u00eancias; Educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o n\\u00e3o formal e educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o em espa\\u00e7os ampliados; Museus de ci\\u00eancia e educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o museal; Parcerias institucionais entre universidade, escola e espa\\u00e7os de ci\\u00eancia;<\\/p>\\n          <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 460px; margin: 22px auto 26px 0; min-height: auto; padding: 14px 16px;\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-06-09-133445.png\\\" data