elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\\\"fisica-medica\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\\\"F\\u00edsica M\\u00e9dica - imagem 1\\\" style=\\\"display:block; width:100%; text-decoration:none;\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/ChatGPT-Image-17-de-jun.-de-2026-13_25_44-1.png\\\" alt=\\\"F\\u00edsica M\\u00e9dica - imagem 1\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" style=\\\"display:block; width:auto; height:auto; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; cursor:zoom-in;\\\">\\n            <\\/a>\\n          <\\/figure>\\n          <p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__topics\\\">Instrumenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o nuclear; T\\u00e9cnicas com radia\\u00e7\\u00e3o s\\u00edncrotron; Aplica\\u00e7\\u00f5es biom\\u00e9dicas da radia\\u00e7\\u00e3o; Microtomografia e imageamento 3D; Espectrometria e fluoresc\\u00eancia de raios X; Dosimetria de radia\\u00e7\\u00f5es ionizantes; Dosimetria Luminescente; Desenvolvimento de comp\\u00f3sitos luminescentes para dosimetria: Dosimetria qu\\u00edmica Fricke e OSL; Metrologia das radia\\u00e7\\u00f5es ionizantes; Inova\\u00e7\\u00e3o tecnol\\u00f3gica com impress\\u00e3o 3D; Calibra\\u00e7\\u00e3o de detectores; Auditorias e garantia da qualidade em Radioterapia;<\\/p>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; margin: 22px 0 30px;\\\">\\n            <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\" style=\\\"max-width: none; margin: 0; min-height: auto; padding: 12px;\\\">\\n              <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/ChatGPT-Image-17-de-jun.-de-2026-13_25_45-4.png\\\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\\\"yes\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\\\"fisica-medica\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\\\"F\\u00edsica M\\u00e9dica - imagem 2\\\" style=\\\"display:block; width:100%; text-decoration:none;\\\">\\n                <img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/ChatGPT-Image-17-de-jun.-de-2026-13_25_45-4.png\\\" alt=\\\"F\\u00edsica M\\u00e9dica - imagem 2\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" style=\\\"display:block; width:auto; height:auto; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; cursor:zoom-in;\\\">\\n              <\\/a>\\n            <\\/figure>\\n            <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\" style=\\\"max-width: none; margin: 0; min-height: auto; padding: 12px;\\\">\\n              <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/ChatGPT-Image-17-de-jun.-de-2026-13_25_44-3.png\\\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\\\"yes\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\\\"fisica-medica\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\\\"F\\u00edsica M\\u00e9dica - imagem 3\\\" style=\\\"display:block; width:100%; text-decoration:none;\\\">\\n                <img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/ChatGPT-Image-17-de-jun.-de-2026-13_25_44-3.png\\\" alt=\\\"F\\u00edsica M\\u00e9dica - imagem 3\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" style=\\\"display:block; width:auto; height:auto; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; cursor:zoom-in;\\\">\\n              <\\/a>\\n            <\\/figure>\\n          <\\/div>\\n          <p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__topics\\\">Dosimetria para Radioterapia, Braquiterapia e Irradia\\u00e7\\u00e3o de Sangue; Modelagem e simula\\u00e7\\u00e3o em Dosimetria; An\\u00e1lise de elementos tra\\u00e7o; Efeitos biol\\u00f3gicos da radia\\u00e7\\u00e3o; Aplica\\u00e7\\u00f5es cl\\u00ednicas (c\\u00e2ncer, mamografia, irradia\\u00e7\\u00e3o de sangue); Processamento de imagens m\\u00e9dicas.<\\/p>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; margin: 22px 0 12px;\\\">\\n            <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\" style=\\\"max-width: none; margin: 0; min-height: auto; padding: 12px;\\\">\\n              <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/Ch